      "message": "test: make tx_mempool_block_doublespend spends conflicting\n\nBoth spends were built identically and signed with determinitsic nonces,\nso they were the same transaction rather than a double-spend. In the\nlast case, the mempool transaction was therefore removed because it was\nmined, not because it conflicted with the block.\n\nGive the spends a different output values so they are actually\nconflicting transactions.",
